## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to design a practical, cost-aware data plane for a multi-tenant SaaS, focusing on basic components and governance.

## Key Concepts

- MQTT to IoT Hub ingestion
- Serverless compute with Functions
- Cosmos DB per-tenant partitioning
- Power BI integration for dashboards
- RBAC and data retention
- Drift detection and basic DR

